{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Paul Urges Forgiveness"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I determined this within myself, that I would not come again to you in sorrow. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if I make you sorrowful, then who is he who makes me glad but the one who is made sorrowful by me?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Forgive the Offender"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I wrote this very thing to you, lest, when I came, I should have sorrow over those from whom I ought to have joy, having confidence in you all that my joy is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the joy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of you all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For out of much "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "tribulation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "affliction and anguish of heart I wrote to you, with many tears, not that you should be grieved, but that you might know the love which I have so abundantly for you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if anyone has caused grief, he has not grieved me, but all of you to some extent—not to be too severe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This punishment which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was inflicted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the majority "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sufficient for such a man, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "so that, on the contrary, you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "ought"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " rather to forgive and comfort "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", lest perhaps such a one be swallowed up with too much sorrow. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I urge you to reaffirm "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " love to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For to this end I also wrote, that I might put you to the test, whether you are obedient in all things. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now whom you forgive anything, I also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "forgive"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU indeed, what I have forgiven, if I have forgiven anything, I did it for your sakes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if indeed I have forgiven anything, I have forgiven that one for your sakes in the presence of Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "lest Satan should take advantage of us; for we are not ignorant of his devices."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Triumph in Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Furthermore, when I came to Troas to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "preach"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Christ’s gospel, and a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Opportunity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "door was opened to me by the Lord, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I had no rest in my spirit, because I did not find Titus my brother; but taking my leave of them, I departed for Macedonia."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now thanks "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to God who always leads us in triumph in Christ, and through us "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "manifests"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "diffuses the fragrance of His knowledge in every place. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we are to God the fragrance of Christ among those who are being saved and among those who are perishing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To the one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the aroma of death "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "leading"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to death, and to the other the aroma of life "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "leading"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to life. And who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sufficient for these things? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we are not, as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M the rest"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "so many, peddling"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "adulterating for gain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the word of God; but as of sincerity, but as from God, we speak in the sight of God in Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}